9</td><td>同知识对象/路线/学习事件</td></tr><tr data-status="未来" data-phase="D"><td><code>UI-096</code><br><small>图谱与空间</small></td><td><strong>Scene2_5D / Scene3D</strong></td><td>未来<br>批次 D</td><td>F09/Three/R3F</td><td>坐标单位、布局版本、懒加载</td></tr><tr data-status="未来" data-phase="D"><td><code>UI-097</code><br><small>图谱与空间</small></td><td><strong>XrDevicePanel / ExternalPlayer</strong></td><td>未来<br>批次 D</td><td>F13/Godot/OpenXR</td><td>设备/输入/定位/发行独立验</td></tr><tr data-status="改造" data-phase="B"><td><code>UI-098</code><br><small>互通协同与恢复</small></td><td><strong>InteropProfilePicker / Qualification</strong></td><td>改造<br>批次 B</td><td>交换/资料页</td><td>平台×版本×功能×方向×样本</td></tr><tr data-status="改造" data-phase="B"><td><code>UI-099</code><br><small>互通协同与恢复</small></td><td><strong>ImportPreview / Mapping / LossReport</strong></td><td>改造<br>批次 B</td><td>现有导入/交换任务</td><td>外部ID/未知数据/损失透明</td></tr><tr data-status="改造" data-phase="B"><td><code>UI-100</code><br><small>互通协同与恢复</small></td><td><strong>ExportWizard / RoundtripReceipt</strong></td><td>改造<br>批次 B</td><td>现有交换接线</td><td>源软件真实打开，导出不是往返</td></tr><tr data-status="未来" data-phase="D"><td><code>UI-101</code><br><small>互通协同与恢复</small></td><td><strong>IncrementalSync / ConflictWorkbench</strong></td><td>未来<br>批次 D</td><td>F03/F10</td><td>基准revision/tombstone/撤销/重试</td></tr><tr data-status="复用" data-phase="B"><td><code>UI-102</code><br><small>互通协同与恢复</small></td><td><strong>BackupPanel / RestoreReceipt</strong></td><td>复用<br>批次 B</td><td>BackupPanel/RecoveryShell</td><td>SQLite/CAS/schema身份与独立副本恢复</td></tr><tr data-status="复用" data-phase="A"><td><code>UI-103</code><br><small>互通协同与恢复</small></td><td><strong>RecoveryShell / SafeMode</strong></td><td>复用<br>批次 A</td><td>RecoveryShell/App</td><td>保留错误原因、重试、日志、恢复、退出</td></tr><tr data-status="改造" data-phase="A"><td><code>UI-104</code><br><small>系统能力与边界</small></td><td><strong>CapabilityCatalog / Detail</strong></td><td>改造<br>批次 A</td><td>CanonicalCapabilitiesSpace</td><td>完整权威投影、前提/降级/下一步</td></tr><tr data-status="复用" data-phase="A"><td><code>UI-105</code><br><small>系统能力与边界</small></td><td><strong>ImplementationHealth / EngineReceipt</strong></td><td>复用<br>批次 A</td><td>能力握手/Job</td><td>声明≠执行≠引擎质量通过</td></tr><tr data-status="未来" data-phase="D"><td><code>UI-106</code><br><small>系统能力与边界</small></td><td><strong>ProviderModelSettings / OutboundScope</strong></td><td>未来<br>批次 D</td><td>CAP-0150/F07/F11</td><td>真实模型/出境范围/预算，不默认全库上传</td></tr><tr data-status="改造" data-phase="D"><td><code>UI-107</code><br><small>系统能力与边界</small></td><td><strong>WorkerManager / JobControls</strong></td><td>改造<br>批次 D</td><td>活动/握手</td><td>真实支持的取消/检查点/重试</td></tr><tr data-status="未来" data-phase="D"><td><code>UI-108</code><br><small>系统能力与边界</small></td><td><strong>PermissionBudget / ConnectionDetail</strong></td><td>未来<br>批次 D</td><td>CAP-0130/0150</td><td>Core策略，插件自声明不等于批准</td></tr><tr data-status="未来" data-phase="D"><td><code>UI-109</code><br><small>系统能力与边界</small></td><td><strong>PluginSkillLifecycle</strong></td><td>未来<br>批次 D</td><td>F11</td><td>manifest/禁用/升级/兼容/退出</td></tr><tr data-status="未来" data-phase="D"><td><code>UI-110</code><br><small>系统能力与边界</small></td><td><strong>Compatibility / Maintenance / ExportIdentity</strong></td><td>未来<br>批次 D</td><td>F14</td><td>供体revision/合同/NOTICE/迁出</td></tr><tr data-status="新增" data-phase="A"><td><code>UI-111</code><br><small>系统能力与边界</small></td><td><strong>Preferences / Accessibility</strong></td><td>新增<br>批次 A</td><td>旧偏好/新Tokens</td><td>主题/密度/语言/减少运动持久化</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id="delivery"><h2>11 · 任务模板、实施顺序与验收</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>任务模板</th><th>关键组合</th><th>验收重点</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>内容/资料</td><td>全能力Nav + 资料表 + Reader/Editor + 按需Inspector</td><td>可保存未核验内容；真实重启读回；来源hash与文本指纹分别记录</td></tr><tr><td>核验/证据</td><td>原件对照 + Fidelity + ProfessionalBasis + HumanRecognition</td><td>不同维度不同结论仍能保存；失败不是反证；修改绑定新版本</td></tr><tr><td>学习</td><td>队列 + 实际题目 + 作答 + 提示/依据 + 客观反馈 + 自评/调度</td><td>独立作答；提示使用可追；客观评分与自评分开；event重试不重复</td></tr><tr><td>AI纠正</td><td>真实回答 + 对照纠正 + 审核 + 独立复测 + 资产详情</td><td>候选→认可→有范围使用→评测/退化/撤回</td></tr><tr><td>未来详情</td><td>目录 + 用途 + 前提 + 降级 + 状态</td><td>全部能力可搜可读；无实现不执行；未知不变健康</td></tr><tr><td>互通</td><td>Profile + 映射/损失 + 往返回执</td><td>真实源软件回读；保全未知字段不等于可操作功能等价</td></tr><tr><td>课程/空间</td><td>Course/SpatialPackage + Player + 仿真 + 文本/2D降级</td><td>对象/资源/参数/方法/坐标/学习事件保存恢复；设备独立验</td></tr><tr><td>恢复</td><td>RecoveryShell + Backup/Restore + JobDetail</td><td>Core未启动仍可恢复；不丢当前可靠性路径</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>批次</th><th>范围</th><th>与现有规划对接</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A</td><td>导航、主题、壳、基础交互、恢复；星环Logo与图标</td><td>统一菜单来源和旧深链；三主题可用；保留Core接线</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>资料/编辑/阅读、两维核验、版本/来源、互通与旧主图</td><td>Q04/Q05/Q11与F01/F03基础；真实读写/恢复/损失</td></tr><tr><td>C</td><td>题目/作答/反馈/调度、AI纠正审核复测与资产</td><td>Q08及F04/F07；自评不证明掌握，审核不证明复测</td></tr><tr><td>D</td><td>集合/公式、科研、课程、仿真、空间/XR、同步/插件/移动</td><td>F00–F14依赖逐切片；长期范围不缩减</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>A–D为本报告工作分解，实施时映射到已有Q/F和有效Requirement/CAP，不另建第二套项目任务账本。视觉验证覆盖三主题、主要任务和代表状态、1440/窄窗、Windows100/125/150/200%缩放、中文IME、键盘/焦点、屏幕阅读器、减少运动。CSS px、DIP和截图像素分别记录。</p><p>建议组件目录：design-system/{tokens,themes,primitives}、shell/{navigation,tabs,inspector,activity}、features/{library,evidence,learning,ai-assets,interop,capabilities,recovery}。领域行为留在Feature/Core端口；基础组件不直接持有数据库/worker逻辑。</p><p>下一轮具体交付应包含源码、主题与状态展示、主图/图标实际引用、代表性真实旅程、未验缺口。不能把编译、握手或静态截图单独解释为全部能力完成。</p></section><section id="sources"><h2>12 · 可复核来源与限制</h2><p>GitHub链接固定到本轮main；仅目录元数据不视为全文审阅。上传七图全部直接看图；关键小字已裁切放大，不能识别的保持未确认。</p><ol><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/docs/architecture/CURRENT_ARCHITECTURE.md">现行架构</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/docs/DOCUMENTATION_AUTHORITY_INDEX.md">权威索引</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/DECISION_SUPERSESSION_LEDGER.yaml">决定覆盖</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/docs/authority/taskpack-1004-aaos01/00_两包共同架构与交接规则.md">AAOS01共同架构</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/docs/authority/taskpack-1004-aaos01/01_完整执行任务书.md">AAOS01任务书</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/docs/current/AAOS01-Q00-Q15-LEDGER-FINAL-20261005.md">最新Q账本</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/docs/truth/CAPABILITY_ATLAS_V2.yaml">能力Atlas</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/frontend/src/spaces/spaces.ts">九入口</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/frontend/src/app/App.tsx">App壳</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/frontend/src/spaces/SpaceView.tsx">空间分发</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/frontend/src/design-system/tokens.css">当前Tokens</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/frontend/src/spaces/CanonicalCapabilitiesSpace.tsx">能力页</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/frontend/src/spaces/CanonicalLearningSpace.tsx">学习页</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/frontend/src/spaces/CanonicalLibrarySpace.tsx">资料页</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/frontend/src/components/CheckPanel.tsx">核验</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/frontend/src/components/MachineAnswerPanel.tsx">机器回答纠正</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/frontend/src/components/AaosIcon.tsx">已迁移图标</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/apps/ArcheAxis.Desktop/ThemePalette.cs">旧三主题</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/apps/ArcheAxis.Desktop/AaosBrandMark.axaml">星环标</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/docs/current/AAOS-UI-ASSET-MANIFEST-20261001.json">资产manifest</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/docs/current/AAOS-UI-COSMIC-ASSET-SOURCES-20261001.md">配图出处</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/docs/current/AAOS-UI-THIRD-PARTY-ICON-SOURCES-20261001.md">图标出处</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/docs/current/AAOS-UI-ASSET-INDEX-20260927.md">旧资产索引（本轮前120行）</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94/docs/current/AAOS-UI-MASTER-ASSET-AUDIT-20261001.md">历史母版审计</a></li></ol><p>全文已读：AAOS_UI深度优化调研与Codex执行方案_2026-09-28.md（208行）；执行摘要(20260930-082220)（239行）；AAOS_未来延展与可持续架构_完整方案_20261004.md（309行）。后两份分别是历史混合调研与最新未来方案，不能混同权威层级。</p><p>旧资产报告有时态冲突：早期母版审计称仅ICO引用，后更新manifest/配图来源记planet已在旧Home渲染。新React迁移仍需重新核对；本轮没有取得旧仓PNG可读字节，没有声称逐张旧配图审阅。初版上传图已取得可读像素，与此限制不同。</p></section></main></div><dialog id="zoom"><div class="zoom-bar"><button id="close-zoom" type="button">关闭</button><label>放大 <input id="zoom-range" type="range" min="50" max="350" step="10" value="100"></label><span>滚动查看 · Esc关闭</span></div><div class="zoom-body"><img id="zoom-image" alt="放大参考图"></div></dialog><a class="top" href="#top">返回顶部</a><footer>主题卡演示迁移令牌；JSON/CSS是规格草案，未自动安装或修改AAOS。全部原图与放大图内嵌，可离线查看。</footer><script>
const spec={"schema":"aaos.ui.component-proposal/v1","date":"2026-10-06","status":"ANALYSIS_SPEC_ONLY","main_sha":"8519ba4e5d22bb911068b2f0bbe0d94934123f94","authority_note":"Implementation proposal, not a replacement Authority/CAP/task ledger. Source-review status is not runtime qualification.","themes":{"black":{"label":"黑色","background":"#050505","sidebar":"#0B0B0B","surface":"#0B0B0B","raised":"#121212","border":"#3B4146","text":"#F5F5F5","muted":"#A5ADB3","primary":"#F5F5F5","on_primary":"#101214","gold":"#B6AA8D","success":"#22C55E","warning":"#F59E0B","danger":"#EF4444","info":"#A5ADB3","selected":"#292E32","focus":"#F5F5F5","overlay":"#99050505"},"white":{"label":"白色","background":"#F8F6EB","sidebar":"#F0ECE1","surface":"#FFFFFF","raised":"#ECE8DD","border":"#C8C2B4","text":"#172033","muted":"#586575","primary":"#147F78","on_primary":"#FFFFFF","gold":"#9A6F21","success":"#187A59","warning":"#8A611C","danger":"#B33A3A","info":"#245FA8","selected":"#D8EFEA","focus":"#147F78","overlay":"#66172033"},"cosmic":{"label":"科技／深空／宇宙／星环","background":"#081020","sidebar":"#0C1728","surface":"#101D2E","raised":"#1A2233","border":"#27516B","text":"#F8F6EB","muted":"#96AAB4","primary":"#2EC4B6","on_primary":"#081020","gold":"#F4D08B","success":"#37C99A","warning":"#E6BE73","danger":"#E56464","info":"#3B82F6","selected":"#173B47","focus":"#2EC4B6","overlay":"#9E081020"}},"proposed_navigation_groups":[["工作台","最近/继续、任务概览、项目入口","CAP-0090/0120"],["内容与知识","捕获/导入、原件、文档/创作、知识、集合/版本","CAP-0010/0020/0110"],["证据与研究","锚点、专业核验、支持/反证、文献、项目/实验","CAP-0030/0090"],["学习与教学","诊断、练习、复习、讲解/迁移、课程/仿真","CAP-0040/0060/0070"],["AI资产与纠正","受控回答、纠错/审核/复测、记忆/规则/技能","CAP-0050/0150"],["图谱与空间","搜索/图谱、2D/2.5D/3D记忆空间、XR","CAP-0080/0110/0160"],["互通与协同","平台profile、迁入迁出/往返、同步/冲突","CAP-0100/0120/0140"],["系统与能力","能力、Provider/worker、预算/权限、主题、备份恢复","CAP-0120/0130/0140/0150"]],"components":[{"id":"UI-001","family":"基础组件","name":"Button / IconButton","status":"改造","basis":"现有button/CSS","behavior":"主/次/危险/busy/disabled_reason；图标动作有名称","domain":"UI交互 / 语义Tokens","phase":"A","themes":["black","white","cosmic"],"proposal":true},{"id":"UI-002","family":"基础组件","name":"Field / Input / Textarea","status":"改造","basis":"现有表单","behavior":"标签/帮助/错误关联；中文IME不误提交","domain":"UI交互 / 语义Tokens","phase":"A","themes":["black","white","cosmic"],"proposal":true},{"id":"UI-003","family":"基础组件","name":"Checkbox / RadioGroup / Switch","status":"新增","basis":"交互供体候选","behavior":"controlled值、键盘，不把不可逆动作做开关","domain":"UI交互 / 语义Tokens","phase":"A","themes":["black","white","cosmic"],"proposal":true},{"id":"UI-004","family":"基础组件","name":"Select / Combobox","status":"改造","basis":"现有select","behavior":"值/名称分离、搜索、选项焦点","domain":"UI交互 / 语义Tokens","phase":"A","themes":["black","white","cosmic"],"proposal":true},{"id":"UI-005","family":"基础组件","name":"Tabs / SegmentedControl","status":"改造","basis":"页内导航","behavior":"activeKey/面板关系，切换不丢输入","domain":"UI交互 / 语义Tokens","phase":"A","themes":["black","white","cosmic"],"proposal":true},{"id":"UI-006","family":"基础组件","name":"Dialog / AlertDialog","status":"新增","basis":"Radix候选","behavior":"圈定/返回焦点，明确对象与动作","domain":"UI交互 / 语义Tokens","phase":"A","themes":["black","white","cosmic"],"proposal":true},{"id":"UI-007","family":"基础组件","name":"Sheet / Drawer / Popover","status":"改造","basis":"Inspector基础","behavior":"Escape、遮罩、非模态编辑边界","domain":"UI交互 / 语义Tokens","phase":"A","themes":["black","white","cosmic"],"proposal":true},{"id":"UI-008","family":"基础组件","name":"Dropdown / ContextMenu","status":"新增","basis":"交互供体","behavior":"键盘方向键、不可用原因","domain":"UI交互 / 语义Tokens","phase":"A","themes":["black","white","cosmic"],"proposal":true},{"id":"UI-009","family":"基础组件","name":"Tooltip / HoverCard","status":"新增","basis":"交互供体","behavior":"关键信息不只悬停","domain":"UI交互 / 语义Tokens","phase":"A","themes":["black","white","cosmic"],"proposal":true},{"id":"UI-010","family":"基础组件","name":"Badge / StatusChip","status":"改造","basis":"已有状态文本","behavior":"文字+图标，状态维度/出处","domain":"UI交互 / 语义Tokens","phase":"A"